      },
      "source": [
        "# Twin-Delayed Deep Deterministic Policy Gradient (TD3) [50 marks]\n",
        "<a id=\"td3\"></a>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "sDeZbhxuEELd"
      },
      "source": [
        "Implement the Twin-delayed deep deterministic policy gradient (TD3) agent. We have studied about TD3 agent in the Lecture. Use the function definitions (given below).\n",
        "\n",
        "This class implements the TD3 agent, you are required to implement the various methods of this class\n",
        "as outlined below. Note this class is generic and should work with any permissible Gym environment\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "class DDPG():\n",
        "    def init(env, gamma, tau,\n",
        "    bufferSize ,\n",
        "    updateFrequencyPolicy ,\n",
        "    updateFrequencyValue ,\n",
        "    trainPolicyFrequency ,\n",
        "    policyOptimizerFn ,\n",
        "    valueOptimizerFn ,\n",
        "    policyOptimizerLR ,\n",
        "    valueOptimizerLR ,\n",
        "    MAX TRAIN EPISODES,\n",
        "    MAX EVAL EPISODE,\n",
        "    optimizerFn )\n",
        "    \n",
        "    def runTD3 (self)\n",
        "    def trainAgent (self)\n",
        "    def gaussianStrategy (self, net , s , envActionRange , noiseScaleRatio ,\n",
        "        explorationMax = True)\n",
        "    def greedyStrategy (self, net , s , envActionRange)\n",
        "    def trainNetworks (self,experiences , envActionRange)\n",
        "    def updateValueNetwork(self, onlineNet, targetNet, tau)\n",
        "    def updatePolicyNetwork(self, onlineNet, targetNet, tau)\n",
        "    def evaluateAgent (self)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "8etrHpz4EELd"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "class TD3():\n",
        "    def __init__(self,env, gamma, tau,\n",
        "    bufferSize ,\n",
        "    updateFrequencyPolicy ,\n",
        "    updateFrequencyValue ,\n",
        "    trainPolicyFrequency ,\n",
        "    policyOptimizerFn ,\n",
        "    valueOptimizerFn ,\n",
        "    policyOptimizerLR ,\n",
        "    valueOptimizerLR ,\n",
        "    MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES,\n",
        "    MAX_EVAL_EPISODE,\n",
        "    optimizerFn):\n",
        "        #this TD3 method\n",
        "        # 1. creates and initializes (with seed) the environment, train/eval episodes, gamma, etc.\n",
        "        # 2. creates and intializes all the variables required for book-keeping values via the initBookKeeping method\n",
        "        # 3. creates targetValueNetwork , targetPolicyNetwork\n",
        "        # 4. creates and initializes (with network params) the optimizer function\n",
        "        # 5. creates onlineValueNetwork, onlinePolicyNetwork\n",
        "        # 6. Creates the replayBuffer\n",
        "\n",
        "        #Your code goes in here\n",
        "        self.env                   = env\n",
        "        self.gamma                 = gamma\n",
        "        self.tau                   = tau\n",
        "        self.updateFrequencyPolicy = updateFrequencyPolicy\n",
        "        self.updateFrequencyValue  = updateFrequencyValue\n",
        "        self.trainPolicyFrequency  = trainPolicyFrequency\n",
        "        self.MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES    = MAX_TRAIN_EPISODES\n",
        "        self.MAX_EVAL_EPISODES     = MAX_EVAL_EPISODE\n",
        "\n",
        "        # Fixed defaults\n",
        "        self.noiseScaleRatio   = 0.5\n",
        "        self.minSamples        = 1000\n",
        "        self.maxGradNormPolicy = 50.0\n",
        "        self.maxGradNormValue  = 50.0\n",
        "        self.batch_size        = 256\n",
        "        self.seed              = 1\n",
        "\n",
        "        torch.manual_seed(self.seed)\n",
        "        np.random.seed(self.seed)\n",
        "\n",
        "        obs_dim     = env.observation_space.shape[0]\n",
        "        act_dim     = env.action_space.shape[0]\n",
        "        action_high = env.action_space.high\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.envActionRange = (env.action_space.low, env.action_space.high)\n",
        "        self.onlinePolicyNetwork  = PolicyNetwork(obs_dim, act_dim, action_high)\n",
        "        self.targetPolicyNetwork  = PolicyNetwork(obs_dim, act_dim, action_high)\n",
        "        self.onlineValueNetwork1  = ValueNetwork(obs_dim, act_dim)\n",
        "        self.onlineValueNetwork2  = ValueNetwork(obs_dim, act_dim)\n",
        "        self.targetValueNetwork1  = ValueNetwork(obs_dim, act_dim)\n",
        "        self.targetValueNetwork2  = ValueNetwork(obs_dim, act_dim)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.updatePolicyNetwork(self.onlinePolicyNetwork,\n",
        "                                 self.targetPolicyNetwork, tau=1.0)\n",
        "        self.updateValueNetwork(self.onlineValueNetwork1,\n",
        "                                self.targetValueNetwork1,  tau=1.0)\n",
        "        self.updateValueNetwork(self.onlineValueNetwork2,\n",
        "                                self.targetValueNetwork2,  tau=1.0)\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.policyOptimizerFn = policyOptimizerFn(\n",
        "            self.onlinePolicyNetwork.parameters(), lr=policyOptimizerLR)\n",
        "        self.valueOptimizerFn  = valueOptimizerFn(\n",
        "            list(self.onlineValueNetwork1.parameters()) +\n",
        "            list(self.onlineValueNetwork2.parameters()), lr=valueOptimizerLR)\n",
        "\n",
        "        self.rBuffer = ReplayBuffer(bufferSize, self.batch_size, self.seed)\n",
        "        self._initBookKeeping()\n",
        "\n",
        "    def _initBookKeeping(self):\n",
        "        self.trainRewardsList  = []\n",
        "        self.trainTimeList     = []\n",
        "        self.evalRewardsList   = []\n",
        "        self.wallClockTimeList = []\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
